  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now the \"Add to Favorite\" button is at the bottom right corner of the website. This is a relatively hard to see / reach spot for such an important button.\n# Suggestion:\nI would suggest moving the button above the World Details while at the same time shortening the box with the info on how many People are in Public Instances. \nThat way you can still keep the Description aligned with the World Details and in cases where there aren't any people in public instances I would still keep that box there. In that case I would change the message though, this is what I had in mind \"There are currently 0 players in public instances of this world, create a new one with the Launch button!\".\n# Attachments:\nThe first picture shows the current layout and the second one shows my concept:",
